    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<i>This isn\u2019t just another survival game\u2014I\u2019ve spent five years creating it and three more releasing updates. <strong><u>The game has vastly improved since most of its reviews were posted</u></strong>. While I\u2019m not currently posting updates, I\u2019m still actively working on the game behind the scenes. I would really appreciate your support in buying a copy, after all, all purchase funds go back into development, not my pocket. If you have questions, you can reach me via the Community Hub or email anytime.</i>&quot; - Dev \ud83d\udc99</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new era commences. The Age of Technology has ended, allowing nature to reestablish balance and order. This emerging world, abundant in diverse animal and plant life, presents renewed challenges rooted in fundamental survival: agriculture, hunting, defence, and the construction of adequate shelter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Success now depends on the ability to adapt, establish a foundation, and seek progress within this revitalized environment. Will you persevere to live with the land? Or will you strip the world bare, kill anything in sight, and rule with an iron fist?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The objective is for Jack to survive within the natural ecosystem, using available strategies or resources.\u00a0Help Jack secure food, water, clothing, and shelter\u2014whether a modest home or a tall building. Assist him in developing expansive farms, staying warm and dry, and crafting stronger tools to overcome bigger challenges. Protect him against hostile animals and elements, using brain or brawn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <u><strong>A BALANCED WORLD</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234380/extras/8d653d4e5d53ce4c0dd35c9ce07ab15e.avif?t=1753880888\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jack can explore a world with changing weather, temperature, and day-night cycles. He'll find various pickups, forests and ponds to utilize in his quest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udff9 <u><strong>GO HUNTING</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udff9</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234380/extras/a62799601d8f92851c1cd1457383e7da.avif?t=1753880888\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make Jack a bow and send him out; he'll mostly be hunting wolves and bears, which are both dangerous predators. Equipped with a bow, strong armour and a good sense of aim, Jack will be eating his first cooked bear meat soon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddfa <u><strong>SUBSISTENCE FARMING</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>\ud83e\uddfa</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234380/extras/4119ba5ae1bcd7530599eb32fd7e5a06.avif?t=1753880888\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate a variety of vegetables, ensuring their proper irrigation and care until that sweet harvest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <u><strong>CONSTRUCTION</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234380/extras/b0acd05f45c8ebce009e5990df6339d3.avif?t=1753880888\" /></div> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jack needs a dry, warm place to sleep and relax. Build him any type of home using at least 15 construction parts, in any design or size.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udce6 <u><strong>RESOURCE MANAGEMENT</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udce6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234380/extras/aa6c81e9e2a7b418cf228a875ec1bde2.avif?t=1753880888\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jack should manage his available resources efficiently. If he continues to remove all the trees near his home, he will eventually need to travel increasingly greater distances to obtain additional wood. He should also utilise his storage capacity judiciously by prioritising essential items and avoiding unnecessary accumulation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa3 <u><strong>FISHING</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udfa3</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234380/extras/120d9b3b191f6ebed0cd25ae7b907d43.avif?t=1753880888\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jack has several long-term survival strategies. Residing near a wolf den can help maintain a steady food source, as can living close to a dam and fishing for meals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<i>And much more! Seriously! I promise you; this is the most unique game you've ever played.\u00a0Unique gameplay that exists thanks to a unique software design.\u00a0I would really appreciate your support in buying a copy, after all, all purchase funds go back into development, not my pocket.</i>&quot; - Dev \ud83d\udc99</p>",
